    <rigor-reason>Adds NEW Dataverse attributes to an existing entity (`sprk_communication`) — no BFF code, no Step 9.5 gates. STANDARD per §8 (new-surface schema creation with constraints). §11 Component Justification REQUIRED (triage fields are new surface). Additive/non-breaking is load-bearing (NFR-04) — existing `sprk_communication` columns MUST survive untouched. Verify-or-create: the operator may have pre-created these in parallel.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>P1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
